>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>其實<rt>기싣ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ki-sît goà ai’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>全<rt>좐-</rt></ruby><ruby>宇宙<rt>우ˆ듀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上愛<rt>셩애</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    joan-û-tiū siong-ai’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>喙<rt>취</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kâ̰-kông-chût-chui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大聲<rt>돠샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>我愛你<rt>ㄨㄛˇ ㄞˋ ㄋㄧˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa-siā̰-kòng, <i>wǒ ài nǐ</i>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>三冬<rt>살ˉ당ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>半<rt>봘</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sū-liām’e siēng-oâh î-kiēng-sā̰-tāng-poa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>情批<rt>졩풰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>完<rt>완ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jieng-phuê siâ-oán si-m-kâ̰-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在室<rt>재셱</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà jai-siek e-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>半暝<rt>봘ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>地獄<rt>데꼑ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>折磨<rt>졛ˆ뽜ˊ</rt></